OL,3,GNEWSAIsland Development Plan inquiry
OL,4,Acosts #150,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquiry into proposed changes to
OL,7,FGuernsey's Island Development Plan cost
OL,8,Fan estimated #150,000, according to a
OL,9,FFreedom of Information response.
OL,11,FThe figure was released ahead of a
OL,12,Fdebate on affordable housing sites
OL,13,Fscheduled for the beginning of
OL,14,FNovember.
OL,16,FThe request asked for the total cost of
OL,17,Fthe inquiry that led to the planning
OL,18,Finspector's decision in 2026, including
OL,19,Ftravel, room hire, hotel meals,
OL,20,Fprinting and the cost of States
OL,21,Femployees involved in the process.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
