OL,3,GNEWSAIsland Development Plan inquiry
OL,4,Acosts #150,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn its response, the Committee for the
OL,7,FEnvironment & Infrastructure said the
OL,8,Fplanning inquiry was a required part of
OL,9,Fthe statutory process for the focused
OL,10,Freview of the Island Development Plan.
